{"id":"p2x4","name":"Nested Order Payloads","lang":"pyspark","entry":"solve","params":["spark","input_dir"],"limit_s":30,"ordered":true,"desc":"<p>An e-commerce backend writes its orders as <b>JSON lines</b> files (one JSON object per line) in <code>input_dir</code>. Files can be in sub-folders and all end with <code>.jsonl</code>. Each object looks like this:</p>\n<pre class=\"exv\">{\"order_id\": \"o1\", \"created_at\": \"2026-03-01T10:15:00\",\n \"customer\": {\"id\": \"c7\", \"country\": \"MA\"},\n \"items\": [{\"sku\": \"A1\", \"category\": \"books\", \"qty\": 2, \"unit_price\": 50.0}]}</pre>\n<p>Rules:</p>\n<ol><li>Some lines are broken (not valid JSON): they are ignored.</li><li>The same order can be written several times (retries). Rows with the same <code>order_id</code> are identical: count each order once.</li><li><code>items</code> can be an empty list or be missing. Such an order still counts as an order, with the category <code>\"none\"</code> and a revenue of <code>0</code>.</li><li>The revenue of an item is <code>qty * unit_price</code>. A missing <code>qty</code> counts as <code>1</code>.</li><li>The day is the date part of <code>created_at</code>.</li></ol>\n<p>Your task is to return, for each day and category, the columns <code>day</code> (date), <code>category</code> (string), <code>orders</code> (long, the number of distinct orders with at least one item of this category, or with no item for <code>\"none\"</code>) and <code>revenue</code> (double, rounded to 2 decimals), sorted by <code>day</code>, then <code>category</code>.</p>\n<h4>Example</h4><p class=\"exf\"><code>input_dir/2026/03/01/part-0.jsonl</code></p><pre class=\"exv\">{\"order_id\": \"o1\", \"created_at\": \"2026-03-01T10:15:00\", \"customer\": {\"id\": \"c1\", \"country\": \"MA\"}, \"items\": [{\"sku\": \"A1\", \"category\": \"books\", \"unit_price\": 50.0, \"qty\": 2}, {\"sku\": \"B2\", \"category\": \"games\", \"unit_price\": 19.99}]}\n{\"order_id\": \"o2\", \"created_at\": \"2026-03-01T18:00:00\", \"customer\": {\"id\": \"c2\", \"country\": \"MA\"}, \"items\": []}\n{\"order_id\": \"o3\", \"created_at\": \n{\"order_id\": \"o1\", \"created_at\": \"2026-03-01T10:15:00\", \"customer\": {\"id\": \"c1\", \"country\": \"MA\"}, \"items\": [{\"sku\": \"A1\", \"category\": \"books\", \"unit_price\": 50.0, \"qty\": 2}, {\"sku\": \"B2\", \"category\": \"games\", \"unit_price\": 19.99}]}\n</pre><p class=\"exf\"><code>input_dir/2026/03/02/part-0.jsonl</code></p><pre class=\"exv\">{\"order_id\": \"o4\", \"created_at\": \"2026-03-02T00:05:00\", \"customer\": {\"id\": \"c4\", \"country\": \"MA\"}, \"items\": [{\"sku\": \"A9\", \"category\": \"books\", \"unit_price\": 12.5, \"qty\": 1}, {\"sku\": \"A1\", \"category\": \"books\", \"unit_price\": 50.0, \"qty\": 3}]}\n{\"order_id\": \"o5\", \"created_at\": \"2026-03-02T09:00:00\", \"customer\": {\"id\": \"c5\", \"country\": \"MA\"}}\n</pre><p class=\"exf\"><code>input_dir/2026/_SUCCESS</code></p><pre class=\"exv\"></pre><p>the output should be</p><div class=\"tblw\"><table><tr><th>day</th><th>category</th><th>orders</th><th>revenue</th></tr><tr><td>2026-03-01</td><td>books</td><td>1</td><td>100.0</td></tr><tr><td>2026-03-01</td><td>games</td><td>1</td><td>19.99</td></tr><tr><td>2026-03-01</td><td>none</td><td>1</td><td>0.0</td></tr><tr><td>2026-03-02</td><td>books</td><td>1</td><td>162.5</td></tr><tr><td>2026-03-02</td><td>none</td><td>1</td><td>0.0</td></tr></table></div><div class=\"lim\"><b>[execution time limit]</b> 30 seconds (pyspark)<br><b>[memory limit]</b> 2 GB</div>","starter":"from pyspark.sql import SparkSession, DataFrame, functions as F\n\n\ndef solve(spark: SparkSession, input_dir: str) -> DataFrame:\n    # write your code here\n    return spark.read.json(input_dir)\n","hints":["Donne un schéma explicite à spark.read.json avec mode DROPMALFORMED : sinon une ligne cassée crée une colonne _corrupt_record.","explode_outer garde les commandes avec une liste vide ou absente (la catégorie sera NULL, à remplacer par 'none').","Dédoublonne sur order_id AVANT d'éclater les articles, sinon tu comptes les articles deux fois."],"summary_fr":"Des fichiers JSON lines de commandes, avec une liste d'articles imbriquée. Ignorer les lignes cassées, dédoublonner les commandes, éclater les articles et calculer le chiffre d'affaires par catégorie et par jour, en comptant aussi les commandes sans article.","tags":["JSON lines","schéma explicite","explode_outer","champs imbriqués"],"minutes":22,"source":"Kata Lab","files":{"root":"input_dir","files":{"2026/03/01/part-0.jsonl":"{\"order_id\": \"o1\", \"created_at\": \"2026-03-01T10:15:00\", \"customer\": {\"id\": \"c1\", \"country\": \"MA\"}, \"items\": [{\"sku\": \"A1\", \"category\": \"books\", \"unit_price\": 50.0, \"qty\": 2}, {\"sku\": \"B2\", \"category\": \"games\", \"unit_price\": 19.99}]}\n{\"order_id\": \"o2\", \"created_at\": \"2026-03-01T18:00:00\", \"customer\": {\"id\": \"c2\", \"country\": \"MA\"}, \"items\": []}\n{\"order_id\": \"o3\", \"created_at\": \n{\"order_id\": \"o1\", \"created_at\": \"2026-03-01T10:15:00\", \"customer\": {\"id\": \"c1\", \"country\": \"MA\"}, \"items\": [{\"sku\": \"A1\", \"category\": \"books\", \"unit_price\": 50.0, \"qty\": 2}, {\"sku\": \"B2\", \"category\": \"games\", \"unit_price\": 19.99}]}\n","2026/03/02/part-0.jsonl":"{\"order_id\": \"o4\", \"created_at\": \"2026-03-02T00:05:00\", \"customer\": {\"id\": \"c4\", \"country\": \"MA\"}, \"items\": [{\"sku\": \"A9\", \"category\": \"books\", \"unit_price\": 12.5, \"qty\": 1}, {\"sku\": \"A1\", \"category\": \"books\", \"unit_price\": 50.0, \"qty\": 3}]}\n{\"order_id\": \"o5\", \"created_at\": \"2026-03-02T09:00:00\", \"customer\": {\"id\": \"c5\", \"country\": \"MA\"}}\n","2026/_SUCCESS":""}},"visible":[{"input":{"input_dir":{"__dir__":{"2026/03/01/part-0.jsonl":"{\"order_id\": \"o1\", \"created_at\": \"2026-03-01T10:15:00\", \"customer\": {\"id\": \"c1\", \"country\": \"MA\"}, \"items\": [{\"sku\": \"A1\", \"category\": \"books\", \"unit_price\": 50.0, \"qty\": 2}, {\"sku\": \"B2\", \"category\": \"games\", \"unit_price\": 19.99}]}\n{\"order_id\": \"o2\", \"created_at\": \"2026-03-01T18:00:00\", \"customer\": {\"id\": \"c2\", \"country\": \"MA\"}, \"items\": []}\n{\"order_id\": \"o3\", \"created_at\": \n{\"order_id\": \"o1\", \"created_at\": \"2026-03-01T10:15:00\", \"customer\": {\"id\": \"c1\", \"country\": \"MA\"}, \"items\": [{\"sku\": \"A1\", \"category\": \"books\", \"unit_price\": 50.0, \"qty\": 2}, {\"sku\": \"B2\", \"category\": \"games\", \"unit_price\": 19.99}]}\n","2026/03/02/part-0.jsonl":"{\"order_id\": \"o4\", \"created_at\": \"2026-03-02T00:05:00\", \"customer\": {\"id\": \"c4\", \"country\": \"MA\"}, \"items\": [{\"sku\": \"A9\", \"category\": \"books\", \"unit_price\": 12.5, \"qty\": 1}, {\"sku\": \"A1\", \"category\": \"books\", \"unit_price\": 50.0, \"qty\": 3}]}\n{\"order_id\": \"o5\", \"created_at\": \"2026-03-02T09:00:00\", \"customer\": {\"id\": \"c5\", \"country\": \"MA\"}}\n","2026/_SUCCESS":""}}},"expected":{"columns":["day","category","orders","revenue"],"rows":[["2026-03-01","books",1,100.0],["2026-03-01","games",1,19.99],["2026-03-01","none",1,0.0],["2026-03-02","books",1,162.5],["2026-03-02","none",1,0.0]]}},{"input":{"input_dir":{"__dir__":{"x.jsonl":"{\"order_id\": \"k1\", \"created_at\": \"2026-04-01T23:59:59\", \"customer\": {\"id\": \"c1\", \"country\": \"MA\"}, \"items\": [{\"sku\": \"Z\", \"category\": \"food\", \"unit_price\": 3.0, \"qty\": 0}, {\"sku\": \"Y\", \"category\": \"food\", \"unit_price\": 2.25, \"qty\": 4}]}\nnot json\n"}}},"expected":{"columns":["day","category","orders","revenue"],"rows":[["2026-04-01","food",1,9.0]]}}],"hidden_n":6,"hidden":"","solution":""}